        skos:broader           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/S12/current/S1218/>;
        skos:definition        "The red muscle is also known as slow muscle and depends on aerobic metabolism for energy. This muscle contains a lot of myoglobin, capillaries and also a lot of glycogen and lipids. It is located in most fish as a band along the side of the fish."@en;
        skos:definition        "Le muscle rouge, aussi appelé muscle lent, dépend du métabolisme aérobie pour son énergie. Ce muscle contient beaucoup de myoglobine, de capillaires ainsi que beaucoup de glycogène et de lipides. Il est présent chez la plupart des poissons sous forme de bande le long du flanc."@fr ;
        skos:notation          "SDN:S12::S1245";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "red muscle tissue"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "tissu musculaire rouge"@fr ;
        skos:related           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/S25/current/BE007863/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/S25/current/BE007868/> .

