        owl:deprecated         "false";
        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:definition        "The hepatopancreas, digestive gland or midgut gland is an organ of the digestive tract of arthropods, molluscs and fish. It provides the functions which in mammals are provided separately by the liver and pancreas, including the production of digestive enzymes, and absorption of digested food."@en;
        skos:definition        "L'hépatopancréas, glande digestive ou glande de l'intestin moyen est un organe du tractus digestif des arthropodes, mollusques et poissons. Il assure les fonctions que le foie et le pancréas remplissent séparément chez les mammifères, dont la production d'enzymes digestives et l'absorption des aliments digérés."@fr ;
        skos:notation          "SDN:S12::S1243";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "hepatopancreas"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "hépatopancréas"@fr ;
        skos:related           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/S25/current/BE007826/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/S25/current/BE007820/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/S25/current/BE007823/> .

